# Every page in the system bars: the four tabs scrolled to their foot, Calls, Tasks and Settings
# from the bar buttons and Back from each.
launch /
wait 6
shoot now
scroll home-list-now
scroll home-list-now
shoot now-foot
tap tab-feed
wait 4
shoot feed
scroll home-list-feed
scroll home-list-feed
shoot feed-foot
tap tab-ideas
wait 4
shoot ideas
scroll home-list-ideas
scroll home-list-ideas
shoot ideas-foot
tap tab-goals
wait 4
shoot goals
scroll home-list-goals
scroll home-list-goals
shoot goals-foot
tap tab-now
wait 2
tap bar-calls
wait 3
shoot calls
scroll calls-scroll
scroll calls-scroll
shoot calls-foot
tap bar-back
wait 2
tap bar-tasks
wait 3
shoot tasks
scroll tasks-rows
scroll tasks-rows
shoot tasks-foot
tap bar-back
wait 2
tap bar-settings
wait 3
shoot settings
scroll settings-scroll
scroll settings-scroll
shoot settings-foot
tap bar-back
wait 2
shoot back-home
tree end
